@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed isolated recovery and explicit resumption gate
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Authorized operator" as O
participant "Operations coordinator" as C
participant "Isolated restored stores" as S
participant "Affected resource owners" as R
participant "External-effect adapters" as E
O -> C : identified source / version / intended recovery scope
C -> S : restore compatible records / bytes / Git / key context
note over C,S
 Outbound effects stay disabled during validation.
 No automatic replay from restored pending records.
end note
C -> R : verify manifests / references / usability / current authority
R -> S : inspect actual restored state
S --> R : available / missing / inconsistent evidence
R --> C : bounded findings + current authority disposition
C -> E : reconcile actual provider / executor / target state
E --> C : attributable observations or unresolved effects
alt usable consistent scope and reviewed disposition
 C --> O : measured recovery / loss evidence; eligible for resumption procedure
else missing / unsafe / unresolved scope
 C --> O : retain isolation; report actual blockers
end
note over C,E
 Restored grant rows cannot silently resurrect access.
 Backup completion does not establish usable recovery.
 Promotion follows the owning operating procedure.
end note
@enduml
